        "EXPECTED CONTROL NATURE ALIGNMENT:",
        "  Compare the source Nature field against the expected nature for this CT group.",
        "  Do not infer or substitute a different control nature from the activity text.",
        "  A Preventative control operating in a Preventative CT group = Aligned.",
        "  A Detective control operating in a Preventative CT group = Not Aligned.",
        "",
        "DESIGN STRENGTH GUIDANCE:",
        "  Strong  — Most design principles are met. Few or no material gaps.",
        "  Moderate — Several principles are met but some gaps exist.",
        "  Basic   — Some principles are met but significant gaps exist.",
        "  Limited — Few principles are met. Significant weaknesses identified.",
